        "Implemented validation of copied text, extraction of the answer without the prompt wrapper and writing to the corresponding Markdown topic file under the correct ID. Added checks for a matching answer ID and an unanswered target entry, then implemented atomic temporary-file replacement and post-save verification. Added an option to restore the previous clipboard contents.",
