        "Set up a local Docker Compose stack with ERPNext 15.92.4 and Frappe HRMS based on frappe_docker. Configured MariaDB 10.6, Redis 6.2 for queues and cache, backend, frontend, workers, scheduler and websocket; the portal is served locally on port 8080. Connected the custom `compass_hr_ai` app and HRMS sources through bind mounts, installed the app on the site and enabled developer mode. `frappe_docker` and HRMS are upstream submodules in the repository.",
        "Prepared demo HR configuration: company and organization structure, designations, grades, employment types, a Basic salary component, the `RUB Monthly (Base)` salary structure and a payroll period. Added CSV seed data for 79 demo employees, salary assignments and employment history; the history file contains 126 entries. Configured Compass HR Admin, Compass Manager and Compass Employee roles, baseline DocType permissions and exportable fixtures.",
        "Created the COMPASS-HR workspace with nine shortcuts and 17 custom DocTypes: nine main entities — Employment History, Skill, Role Profile, Employee Skill Profile, Career Prediction, Course, Learning Recommendation, Team Plan and Resume — plus eight child tables for role requirements, employee and course skills, predictions, skill gaps, resume skills and team-plan roles.",
