        "Implemented ETL for career trajectories from the Rostrud/Zenodo dataset. The script detects the separator and maps column names, supports CSV inspection and 200,000-row chunked reads, normalizes job titles, parses dates and groups records by candidate. It produces cleaned work-history Parquet data, role sequences and a separate normalized role catalog. A `--demo-small` mode supports faster demonstration runs.",
        "Built cache-first hh.ru API ingestion with text and region search, configurable pages and result counts, a delay between requests and reuse of cached responses. The parser flattens nested JSON into vacancy ID and title, region, employer, salary and currency, experience, schedule, employment type, requirements, responsibilities, publication date and URL.",
